---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About - US Emergency Local Hub">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">About Us</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-gray-700">
      <p>US Emergency Local Hub is a community-focused directory dedicated to helping homeowners quickly find local emergency restoration services. We understand that water damage, mold, and sewage emergencies don't follow a 9-to-5 schedule — which is why we maintain a 24/7 directory of verified local providers.</p>

      <p>Our mission is to reduce the stress and confusion of home emergencies by providing clear, localized information and direct access to professional help in your area.</p>

      <p>Every city page on our site is researched to include relevant local context — because the risks in humid Florida are different from those in freezing Ohio, and your emergency response should reflect that.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
